				<<checkbox "$settings.toyVirginityEnabled" false true autocheck>> Toys can take virginity
				<mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Allows dildos and similar insertable toys (not vibrators) to take vaginal/anal virginity (yours or an NPC's), instead of only ever teasing at the entrance.</span></mouse>
